#NEXUS

[ arcucci2003a_fig4: Theropod consensus, panel A. Checked at 3x: the coelophysoid stem, Ceratosaurus, Carnotaurus and the tetanuran backbone leave one point (a four-way split), and the five tetanuran branches leave one point. TETANURAE, printed beside a stem bracket, is kept as an internal label. 12 tips, 2 polytomies (4, 5 children); 1 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261114). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=12;
    TAXLABELS
        SAUROPODOMORPHA
        Herrerasaurus
        Dilophosaurus
        Coelophysis
        Syntarsus
        Ceratosaurus
        Carnotaurus
        Zupaysaurus
        Sinraptor
        Allosaurus
        Giganotosaurus
        TYRANNOSAURIDAE
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE arcucci2003a_fig4 = [&R] (SAUROPODOMORPHA,(Herrerasaurus,((Dilophosaurus,(Coelophysis,Syntarsus)),Ceratosaurus,Carnotaurus,(Zupaysaurus,Sinraptor,Allosaurus,Giganotosaurus,TYRANNOSAURIDAE)TETANURAE)));
END;
